  "body": "## Changes\r\n\r\n* fix: canonicalize paths that don't exist in the editor service and lsp (#1260)\r\n* feat: ensure a stable format for stdin formatting and optionally in editors (#1261)\r\n* feat(lsp): format jupyter notebook cells (#1262)\r\n* feat(lsp): format untitled documents (#1265)\r\n* feat(lsp): support not using the global config by default (#1264)\r\n* fix(lsp): do not panic on positions that are out of range (#1267)\r\n* fix(lsp): format files outside the cwd with the global config (#1268)\r\n* fix(lsp): apply \"inherit\": true in nested config files (#1269)\r\n* fix(lsp): keep formatting with other configs after a config changes (#1270)\r\n* fix(lsp): exit the process after the exit notification (#1272)\r\n* fix(lsp): log formatting failures to the client (#1273)\r\n* fix(lsp): rebuild the line index when a change ends in changed lines (#1275)\r\n* fix(lsp): store the document version when a change is applied (#1276)\r\n* fix(lsp): pick up gitignore changes without a config change (#1278)\r\n* fix(lsp): correct config completion edits on incomplete input (#1279)\r\n* fix(lsp): retry failed plugin schema downloads and limit the wait on them (#1280)\r\n* fix(lsp): only register completion and hover for config files (#1281)\r\n\r\n## Install\r\n\r\nRun `dprint upgrade` or see https://dprint.dev/install/\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n\r\nThese artifacts have [build provenance attestations](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/security-for-github-actions/using-artifact-attestations/using-artifact-attestations-to-establish-provenance-for-builds).\r\nVerify a download with the [GitHub CLI](https://cli.github.com/):\r\n\r\n```shell\r\ngh attestation verify dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip --repo dprint/dprint\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Checksums\r\n\r\n|Artifact|SHA-256 Checksum|\r\n|:--|:--|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-apple-darwin.zip|cf3efa1f000125feac934f1afcf76daa35dad4c79dc22ae4c58f92de114e0845|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-apple-darwin.zip|1888b152b3541c3690ec5291dd58bde7116e6c8beb4aa1f242187f22071df22f|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip|f75040d7288d3cf0a271b025dedcab589edec6b363c481790ff53850dadae6f5|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc-installer.exe|e7c0380f8d5ed6da422b20d24bb084f381c261e55f08aa89cbdbd545e18efde5|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-pc-windows-msvc.zip|5bce8673fe5ff8c5162d8a51fef54cd98c1213e9d4b37be03bca6cd21b196b09|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|1705b1be1773955e882a69c29aebd3862d5b466c951f47495ad6cb423c224f86|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|c1e709d629caf8c1f8ef8328f2b5136c68dd5e878b36b04403bf9dfd133c559f|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|4c767249bd35be5d3a0fab98a2eb94bcc439330a45d40c2681032d27ed1032b1|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|b90a0e7ede5fbae3e9f4e0e50455902a7e436f575c8db3b9b7fea9b7a0303210|\r\n|dprint-riscv64gc-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|b88f8c1d6affa3743f60404feed51703b8d77306d0fe3b451e4fb7a4e4f84054|\r\n|dprint-loongarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|fbf544f4149e5a6ed7d5feefbb85ee7570cf58fc4dc79e7e6245293669f4f34f|\r\n|dprint-loongarch64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|b100406bc5d3098cd3756b1e7cc7e7c78e05a13e88c4d1593ebb1d3e2a95b26a|\r\n|dprint-powerpc64le-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|06a99164542e750085eacbf8a1f984a93defb2d1755ff1a7f12b0d4ab4c1b75c|\r\n|dprint-powerpc64le-unknown-linux-musl.zip|718fdb164317347fcec31141926992f083167eb9f54a8df5d4dc77b5c5b46478|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-linux-android.zip|3e7d976c0e8cfd088b2ccda2f95e07046341ecf67660ebc5c30835e4c51b4158|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-linux-android.zip|811bd855000846c8eca8976863d4ffd831577dbf8e35071f56300c3efdb48caf|\r\n"
